      ":question/problem": "Using the fact that\n\n$$\n\\frac{2\\pi}{3}=\\frac{5\\pi}{6}-\\frac{\\pi}{6},\n$$\n\ncalculate the **exact** value of $\\cos\\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\\right)$.\n\n$\\cos\\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\\right)=$ {{field-1}}",
